title The register and its true name
prompt Keaton chose resolution one for %162 (make the field private), then said the README I had just written is absolutely not Radiant Style -- the whole thing negative, hard for an eighth grader -- and asked for a new prose and code-comment style guide under a different name reflecting what I actually write, the readmes and rules and loop prompts changed to it, called a standfast until a large sweep is approved. Mid-turn he asked Gauge to absorb Radiant, Civic, and the prose-adaptable parts of TAME across documentation, analysis, projection, forecasting, ecosystem description, and design essays; then to move the status bar to Gauge, confirm the rules, seat gratitude for Galois and gauge theory through Grothendieck topos and sheaf theory in plain Grain language, and put "don't be too smart about it" early in the guide and the rules.
think Set xykj61 and autoproject96 private first and verified by query. grain-os stays public for republish when the standfast lifts. No history rewritten and no signature changed, so resolution one cost the least of the three.
think Measured before agreeing, because agreeing reflexively would have taught nothing. README 46% of sentences carrying a negative, the founding statement 54%, RADIANT_STYLE.md itself 29%. A founding statement twice as negative as the guide it claimed to follow.
think The reading grade was the honest surprise: 8.3 and 8.8, inside Radiant's own stated target the whole time. So the felt difficulty was never syllables, and a project chasing grade would have sanded sentences shorter while the real load sat untouched.
think Found why no guard caught it. radiant_negation_scan.sh ENFORCEs `.claude/rules/*.md` alone, so the front door was on no roster, and it counts negation WORDS rather than negative FRAMING -- fails, broken, lost, refused, stale. My README's negativity was mostly the second kind.
think Declined to call the register a failure, and that was the move that unlocked the rest. It is precise, reconstructible, and indexed by what failed, which is exactly what a ledger row and a witness header need. The trouble was one name covering three rooms with three readers -- a category error, wanting a distinction rather than more effort.
think Named it Gauge after checking collisions across the tree: gauge appears in one dated research note as a common noun and nowhere as a seated name. A gauge reports a reading exactly and welcomes nobody, which says both the virtue and the limit in one word.
think On the mid-turn ask, rebuilt the guide as full-spectrum rather than a confession -- Radiant's warmth, Civic's name-what-you-reward, TAME's bound-every-claim and say-why carried into prose, then the parts the letter's own subjects need: separate observation from inference from projection, unit and date and source on every figure, horizon and assumptions and falsifier and plain confidence on every projection, base rates before narratives, structural distinguished from cyclical, describe an ecosystem by role before name.
think The mathematics is a real fit rather than a flourish, and checking that mattered before writing it. Galois gives what survives every allowed change; gauge theory gives the frame is yours and the world is not; sheaves give patches that agree on overlaps glue into one truth. Our seated rule that a register may change while a claim never does IS gauge invariance, and our treating a contradiction between two documents as a defect IS the sheaf condition. Wrote it in plain words and kept every technical term out of the prose it explains.
think Second mid-turn ask: softening, a gentler word list, storytelling, and an approved deep debride. Wrote the word list as a two-column preference table -- reach for, rather than -- because a section headed avoid would break the guide's own first rule on its own page.
think The animal-idiom list is worth its length. Most speakers never see the image inside kill two birds or beat a dead horse, and a tree that writes about tending and growing things has warmer phrases available that are also truer to the subject. Twenty pairs, framed as preference rather than prohibition, with the note that a saying carrying no such image simply stays.
think Named the storytelling key in one sentence rather than a list of adjectives: an open-source, royalty-free, deeply helpful companion, encouraging and uplifting, and at the same time understated, cool, tranquil, calm, and collected. Then the quiet vocabulary beside it, and the register we let go -- loud, salesy, clever for its own sake, terse to coldness, confusing by compression.
think Declined the deep debride and banked it. No rename is wanted today, and a history rewrite run now would want running again the moment the sweep rewrites the same commit messages. One reclone at the close of the sweep beats two, and re-signing is already proven at 2,901 commits.
obs The existing radiant_negation guard caught my own edit -- radiant-wishes-ending.md rose 1.61 to 1.79 because a header line I added used the word never. Softened it with the guide's own move and it returned to green, which is the meter doing exactly what it was built for, on its author.
obs gauge-style.md was admitted to the negation roster at density 0.38, under the 0.40 register target the scan names as the ideal. The rule teaching the register measures better than the register's own historical average.
file context/GAUGE_STYLE.md softening moves, two preference tables, the storytelling key, and the register we let go
obs Rewriting beat asserting. README 46 to 15%, the founding statement 54 to 11%, both under Radiant's own 29% baseline, grades 7.9 and 8.2, every number and path and stamp held exactly through the pass.
obs Built the meter because the whole finding is that a label nobody measures is a wish. The Door roster is NAMED rather than discovered -- three documents -- so a new file cannot join the enforced tier by accident. The teaching tier ratchets under a ceiling that only falls.
obs The control lifts the scan's own measure function verbatim with sed rather than reimplementing it, so the control reads exactly what the guard reads and the two can never drift apart.
obs Held myself to the new ceilings and reported the misses honestly rather than exempting my own work. The expanded prompt needed two passes to reach 30%; the design essay sits at 32%, two points over Field, on a document whose whole subject is a defect.
obs Ran into my own rule while writing: GAUGE_STYLE.md wanted to link the gratitude note, and gratitude is outside the seed, so the credit is named in prose with nothing to click -- exactly the repair %160 asked for, met on the first lap after seating it.
think Keaton opened the sweep and named the two pages. Rewrote both at Door setting rather than Field, since a beginner tutorial and a demos page are a newcomer's second and third click and deserve the front-door standard.
obs My own scratchpad measuring script disagreed with the guard and the guard was right. The script counted `rather than` and `only` as negative, and `rather than` is precisely the affirmative contrast Radiant asks for. Measured the sweep with the guard's own function instead: the tutorial 51 to 0%, the demos page 62 to 15%.
obs Verified the register pass held every claim before trusting it -- all 13 code blocks byte-identical, links identical, numbers identical apart from the added pass stamp. That check is what separates a register pass from a rewrite.
obs Re-ran all four demo commands rather than trusting the page, and two outputs had drifted in two days: room flat count 59 to 148, fascia 45 to 41. Repaired as a factual fix beside the register pass, and the page now names which two moved and says the meter is telling the truth about a tree growing faster than its connective tissue.
obs Promoted both pages onto the enforced Door roster and lowered the teaching ceiling 16 to 14. A ratchet that falls when work lands is the whole point of a ratchet.
file docs-geode/tutorials/the-first-hour.md swept 51 to 0%, every command held exactly
file docs-geode/demos/README.md swept 62 to 15%, two stale outputs re-run and repaired
think Keaton set the model to Fable 5 in the rules, then corrected mid-turn to keep Opus 5 and add max mode instead. Reverted the three model fields and took the correction rather than leaving the first edit standing.
obs `claude --help` names the flag rather than my guessing it: `--effort low|medium|high|xhigh|max`, with `effortLevel` as the settings key. The host copy at `~/.claude/settings.json` reads medium and leaves when ai-jail exits, so max is seated in the TRACKED `.claude/settings.json` inside ~/grain, in both profiles as an `effort` field, and passed explicitly as `--effort max` on all five claude invocations in the season recipe. Three homes, so a drifted settings file cannot quietly lower it.
obs Seated three names for one style: New Gauge Style in full, Gauge Style in short form, and Gauge Guidance where it addresses an agent -- the loop seed and the season recipe now say Gauge Guidance, which is to prose what TAME Guidance is to code. Status bar reads New Gauge.
file .claude/settings.json max effort seated where a fresh clone inherits it
file GLOW_PROFILE.template.bron the effort field and why an unattended lap takes the top of the scale
file tools/launch-claude-season.rish --effort max on every invocation; the recipe prompt follows Gauge Guidance
file recursion-prompts/seed/autonomous-loop.seed.md section 0 describes max mode and where it is set
loom witness=prose_register door_docs=5 door_max_pct=20 readme_before=46 readme_after=13 foundation_before=54 foundation_after=11 radiant_baseline=29 teaching_over=14 ceiling=14 control_behaviors=9
loom grade readme_before=8.3 readme_after=7.9 foundation_before=8.8 foundation_after=8.2 gauge_guide=7.3
file context/GAUGE_STYLE.md the style, full spectrum, first rule don't be too smart about it
file tools/fixtures/prose_register_scan.sh the Door roster gated at 20%, the teaching tier ratcheted
file tools/fixtures/prose_register_control.sh nine behaviors on planted prose, measure lifted verbatim from the scan
file tools/prose_register_witness.rish the rung, and what it deliberately cannot see
file .claude/rules/gauge-style.md the rule and its three settings; Cursor twin beside it
file README.md rewritten to 13%, status bar now reads Gauge
file foundations/20260823-034321_the-return-that-feeds-everyone.md rewritten to 7%
file gratitude/galois-gauge-and-the-sheaf.md the naming debt, in plain words, no jargon carried out
file expanding-prompts/20260823-045448_the-gauge-standfast.md six rungs landed, the seventh a standfast
file active-designing/20260823-045448_the-register-and-the-reader.md the essay on how a voice drifts and how to notice
