recommend keep-going -- the sweep is open and its first lap landed; the next fourteen teaching-tier documents are mechanical and the order is written in the prompt. The deep debride is banked and unspent by choice; say the word on the sweep and it is spent once at its close. the loop is ready to restart and the field is private, so a lap no longer publishes. The standfast is the one thing waiting on you: 16 teaching-tier documents above target, the beginner tutorial at 51% and the demos page at 62%, and the sweep order is written in the expanded prompt. Say the word and I take those two first. Caravan continues meanwhile under the semi-standfast, each module touched getting a Door-setting opening comment.
